<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ s/adj employment rose 0.8 pct in Sept quarter.</title>
<headline>NZ s/adj employment rose 0.8 pct in Sept quarter.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Friday issued the following provisional, seasonally-adjusted data for September quarter employment and unemployment.</p>
<p>Figures are based on standard international definitions with &quot;revised from&quot; figures in brackets.</p>
<p>		  Sep qtr 1996   Jun qtr 1996	Sep qtr 1995</p>
<p>Unemployment	 6.3 pct     6.1 pct	     6.1 pct</p>
<p>Unemployed	  115,000    110,000 (109,000)   107,000</p>
<p>Employed	   1.702 million   1.688 million (1.686)  1.641 million</p>
<p>Employment growth  +0.8 pct  +1.1 pct (0.9)	+1.0 pct</p>
<p>Participation rate 66.4 pct   65.9 pct (65.8)   64.9 pct</p>
</text>
